# Many levels in one emulator run: reach the first level as first_mission.pad does, then 12 times open
# Rockstar's dev menu (L3+R3, needs MANHUNT_DEVMENU=1), select "Complete level" and press A through the
# results, the save screens and the next intro. One cycle every 80 s. [MH-LEVEL] lines name each level
# loaded. Checked in Ryubing 2026-11-21: the menu keeps its cursor, so only the first cycle moves it.
# 296 steps; run with --secs 1158.
